D6's Coral Pop colours lever, parked (Joe, 27 Nov 2026: option A, left out of the D6 PR; today's levels and Normal unchanged).

bubbleRev 13 (BUB_REV_D6): Easy 3 colours (75 bubbles), Normal 5 (bubbleRev 12's deal, its Bank shots and Speed
figures eased), Hard 6 (an orange seahorse, 100 bubbles), Expert 7 (a pink octopus with a diamond symbol, BUB_SEVENTH,
110 bubbles), each a descent every 8 shots. Measured on 48 room deals a level (scripts/d6-ladder.ts, the skill-band
bots under HUMAN_LIMITS): the average player 154.1 / 58.0 / 41.3 / 19.7, the elite at 200 10 / 0 / 0 / 0 %; the elite
clears the reef 44 / 20 / 3 / 0 times of 48 and fills Chests 41 / 32 / 24 / 3 times. A 200 needs the whole reef, every
chest and every combo, so even Normal cannot reach the 20 % Expert floor (at most 18.8 % with Speed and Bank shots full
on every clear). The deal code (generateBubble, the era pin, the registry rows) was not kept; this patch holds the sim,
renderer and stage parts as written on the D6 branch (23 Nov 2026); it applies to this tree with git apply --3way.

